      "results": [
        {
          "ruleId": "t1-seconds-tsv-and-guards-hold",
          "level": "note",
          "message": {
            "text": "Round 6 delta is 7 lines. t1-steps.tsv start and end are now seconds after launch from 0 (probe tsv: deep 0 1 1 RED, dogfood 0 1 1 RED, models 0 3 3 GO), still the five columns step, start, end, seconds, verdict; the STEP lines and the seconds column are unchanged. 0 is read only in the main shell, never in a lane subshell or in the INT/TERM trap, which reads no clock (interrupt probe: models child gone, one STOP line). The stop-models mutant regex cont[i]nue deletes the continue line (diff shown) and is killed. Guard: 8 cases and 11 of 11 mutants in default and ENFORCE, rc 0 both. check_bashrs_gate.sh rc 0 (517 files, 0 SEC/DET/IDEM errors, 5 SC10xx suppressed, the pre-existing count); check_shell_lint_ratchet.sh rc 0, baseline file untouched, 0 added. No suppression comment added."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "scripts/release/autopilot.sh"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 199
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "properties": {
            "grounding": "measured",
            "command": [
              "bash",
              "t1_join_race_probe.sh",
              "<scratch>"
